{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月6日，OpenAI一口氣公開了722篇由內部AI模型生成的數學手稿。僅過一天，其中3篇就被宣佈撤回。讓三篇手稿一起翻車的，居然只是一處正負號錯誤：一篇出了錯，另外兩篇沿用了同一套構造，也被一併撤回。AI批量交卷之後，兩大巨頭聯手為「驗卷」買單。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585732.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.125217+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:26:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"97cedc0a21e3f59b3298dd6c72bd2b81e389b9771ea7f63a4451c973c5b0f596","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}